orrilla_Hearthflame\" title=\"Korrilla Hearthflame\">Korrilla Hearthflame</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Sharess%27_Caress\" title=\"Sharess' Caress\">Sharess' Caress</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The Black Diamond can be used as substitute for the <a href=\"/wiki/Diamond\" title=\"Diamond\">Diamond</a> in the portal ritual in the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714211439\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1968/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27790/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6656/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936006/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.405      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   44.405      1 -total\n 52.34%   23.243      8 Template:Icon_text\n 45.79%   20.332     18 Template:Trim\n 22.23%    9.872      2 Template:Uid\n 19.31%    8.573      4 Template:Icon_link\n 14.61%    6.487      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.41%    6.397      3 Template:CharLink\n 13.24%    5.878      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.13%    4.943      8 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:11850-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714211439 and revision id 326260. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}